{"about_the_game":"A 1980s-Themed Expansion Pack to enhance Radioactive, with 3 new maps, and 3 new colour schemes emulating the look of some classic 8-bit home computers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpansion Pack 2 contains 3 new maps:<br />\r\nHOT FALKLANDS set on the Falkland Islands.<br />\r\nGREATER SAXONY is a map of the UK and North Western Europe.<br />\r\nPANDEMONIUM is a unique map where units of all sides can appear anywhere rather than in fixed territories.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncludes 3 new colour options:<br />\r\nCOMMODORE 64 emulates the colours of a Commodore 64 computer.<br />\r\nDRAGON 32 pays tribute to the Dragon 32 and Tandy TRS-80 computers.<br />\r\nBBC MICRO emulates many 8-bit computers (like the ZX Spectrum) which used stark primary and secondary colours. The game is played yellow on red.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509580?t=1743580012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743580012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509580/9cbeebc54b1e69aec0c03cb424d7dc03910cb8fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743580012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509580/9cbeebc54b1e69aec0c03cb424d7dc03910cb8fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743580012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"A 1980s-Themed Expansion Pack to enhance Radioactive, with 3 new maps, and 3 new colour schemes emulating the look of some classic 8-bit home computers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpansion Pack 2 contains